# rule_teleport (2026-11-22; decision log D111, standard BOOK 02-architecture/STANDARD-RULES-AS-OPS-FOUNDATION-DESIGN-2026-11-18.md): the TELEPORT block rule as an op. _shared-lib/rule_teleport.c is the pure module (called in-process by game_core's platform tick); rule_teleport_op is its CLI face; event page tm_teleport runs it from Blueprintz.
# PAIRING is derived from the level rows: the teleport tiles are numbered in reading order (top row first, left to right); tile 0 sends to tile 1, tile 2 to tile 3; an odd tile is only an EXIT; an unpaired last tile is inert. The trigger is the body's CENTER cell ((x + w/2, y + h/2) / 256), not an overlap.
# ARRIVAL: center x on the exit cell center (x = cell*256 + 128 - w/2), feet on the exit cell floor (y = (cell+1)*256 - h), vy 0, vx kept, + teleport_fee. Every pinned line is HAND-COMPUTED from those sentences. One scene per clause, each with the plausible-WRONG answer that differs.
# Cells OUTSIDE the level hold the teleport character (the op fills them), so a forgotten bounds test is visible. Hero box 200 x 200 unless said. Level A is 6 wide: tiles at (1,1) and (4,1), ground row 3.
RESULTS | ../results/rule_teleport.txt
ENV | LC_ALL | C

CASE    | setup
SCRATCH |
RUN | /bin/cp | $HOUSE/&.widgits/_shared-lib/ops/+x/rule_teleport_op.+x | $T/rk
EXPECT_EXIT | 0 | scratch-ready
WRITE | trip.pdl | RULE \p teleport_fee \p 0\nTILE \p teleport \p t\nHERO \p 300 \p 300 \p 200 \p 200\nROW \p ......\nROW \p .t..t.\nROW \p ......\nROW \p ######
WRITE | small.pdl | RULE \p teleport_fee \p 0\nTILE \p teleport \p t\nHERO \p 340 \p 340 \p 100 \p 100\nROW \p ......\nROW \p .t..t.\nROW \p ......\nROW \p ######
WRITE | tripvel.pdl | RULE \p teleport_fee \p 0\nTILE \p teleport \p t\nHERO \p 300 \p 300 \p 200 \p 200 \p -77 \p 33\nROW \p ......\nROW \p .t..t.\nROW \p ......\nROW \p ######
WRITE | overlap.pdl | RULE \p teleport_fee \p 0\nTILE \p teleport \p t\nHERO \p 100 \p 300 \p 200 \p 200\nROW \p ......\nROW \p .t..t.\nROW \p ......\nROW \p ######
WRITE | cx256.pdl | RULE \p teleport_fee \p 0\nTILE \p teleport \p t\nHERO \p 156 \p 300 \p 200 \p 200\nROW \p ......\nROW \p .t..t.\nROW \p ......\nROW \p ######
WRITE | cx255.pdl | RULE \p teleport_fee \p 0\nTILE \p teleport \p t\nHERO \p 155 \p 300 \p 200 \p 200\nROW \p ......\nROW \p .t..t.\nROW \p ......\nROW \p ######
WRITE | cy256.pdl | RULE \p teleport_fee \p 0\nTILE \p teleport \p t\nHERO \p 300 \p 156 \p 200 \p 200\nROW \p ......\nROW \p .t..t.\nROW \p ......\nROW \p ######
WRITE | cy255.pdl | RULE \p teleport_fee \p 0\nTILE \p teleport \p t\nHERO \p 300 \p 155 \p 200 \p 200\nROW \p ......\nROW \p .t..t.\nROW \p ......\nROW \p ######
WRITE | onexit.pdl | RULE \p teleport_fee \p 0\nTILE \p teleport \p t\nHERO \p 1052 \p 312 \p 200 \p 200\nROW \p ......\nROW \p .t..t.\nROW \p ......\nROW \p ######
