WRITE | readorder2.pdl | RULE \p teleport_fee \p 0\nTILE \p teleport \p t\nHERO \p 300 \p 300 \p 200 \p 200\nROW \p ....t.\nROW \p .t....\nROW \p ......\nROW \p ######
