WRITE | topedge.pdl | RULE \p teleport_fee \p 0\nTILE \p teleport \p t\nHERO \p 300 \p -300 \p 200 \p 200\nROW \p ......\nROW \p .t..t.\nROW \p ......\nROW \p ######
WRITE | belowy.pdl | RULE \p teleport_fee \p 0\nTILE \p teleport \p t\nHERO \p 300 \p 1100 \p 200 \p 200\nROW \p ......\nROW \p .t..t.\nROW \p ......\nROW \p ######
WRITE | negx2.pdl | RULE \p teleport_fee \p 0\nTILE \p teleport \p t\nHERO \p -200 \p 300 \p 200 \p 200\nROW \p ......\nROW \p t..t..\nROW \p ......\nROW \p ######
