RUN | $T/rk | $T/readorder.pdl
EXPECT_OUT | TELEPORTED 1 SCORE 0 FROM 4,0 TO 1,1 HERO 284,312 | HAND-COMPUTED-the-tile-in-the-TOP-row-(4,0)-is-tile-0-and-sends-to-(1,1)-(column-order-would-pick-(1,1)-first)
