EXPECT_OUT | TELEPORTED 1 SCORE 0 FROM 0,2 TO 3,2 HERO 796,568 | HAND-COMPUTED-four-tiles:-tile-2-(0,2)-sends-to-tile-3-(3,2):-x-768+128-100=796-y-3*256-200=568
