EXPECT_OUT | TELEPORTED 1 SCORE 0 FROM 1,1 TO 4,1 HERO 1052,312 | HAND-COMPUTED-tile-0-sends-to-tile-1-(4,1)-not-to-the-next-tile-in-the-level
