RUN | $T/rk | $T/unpaired.pdl
EXPECT_OUT | TELEPORTED 0 SCORE 0 FROM - TO - HERO 512,612 | HAND-COMPUTED-tile-2-(2,2)-is-even-but-has-no-tile-3:-inert
