EXPECT_EXIT | 0 | the-compiled-wrapper-runs-the-op
EXPECT_OUT | TELEPORTED 1 SCORE 0 FROM 1,1 TO 4,1 HERO 1052,312 VX 0 VY 0 LEVEL ....../.t..t./....../###### | the-page-gives-the-SAME-line-as-the-op-alone
